        <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Imagine exchanging vows in the midst of lush, manicured gardens adorned with vibrant blooms. The natural beauty of our outdoor spaces sets a romantic stage for your ceremony. For indoor celebrations, our sophisticated banquet halls offer timeless elegance and versatility with customizable décor.
        </p>
        <div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; font-size: 13.5px; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
